---
Detect, configure and test the agent CLIs behind a bot

Usage: okbot agent <COMMAND>

Commands:
  detect  Find known CLIs and check version/login without a model call; outside a bot uses your
          login
  status  Show the configured chain, model/effort, login and tool-policy readiness
  use     Promote a primary agent, keeping the remaining agents as fallbacks
  set     Set or clear per-provider model, effort and executable overrides
  chain   Replace the fallback order; preserve all provider overrides for later reuse
  test    Make one tiny live model call (consumes quota), without fallback or access to bot data
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
